>>>markdown
# Cross-model notebook

Imports two models with multi-line `import { ... } from` cells and joins across
them. Before #5568 the setup cell below was mangled into the restricted-query
preamble and every cell 400'd with a Malloy syntax error, rendering Ø.
>>>malloy
import {
  alpha
} from 'metrics_a.malloy'

import {
  beta
} from 'metrics_b.malloy'
>>>markdown
## Alpha total (single model)
>>>malloy
# big_value
run: alpha -> { aggregate: alpha_total }
>>>markdown
## Alpha joined to Beta (cross-model)
>>>malloy
# bar_chart
run: alpha extend {
  join_one: beta on label = beta.label
} -> {
  group_by: label
  aggregate:
    a is alpha_total
    b is beta.beta_total
  order_by: label
}
